            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 7,
              "start": 7
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Thomas E. Redding, the parties discuss the established dual\u2011jurisdiction framework, with pay\u2011and\u2011sue jurisdiction in district courts and pre\u2011payment jurisdiction in the Tax Court."
